WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.240
No puedo creer que esté firmando

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.320
the contract with my own

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.440
father.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.560
So...

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:19.240
Thank you.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.800
They cut off your allowance, huh?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:21.600
They took

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.120
everything.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.440
And I don't even remember

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:25.840
anything from that night.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:27.880
Do you know who that man was?

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.960
You ordered him.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.440
I'm afraid not.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.400
You know, I just paid for

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.320
the service and

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:33.920
they promised me

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.520
the most handsome man.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.520
What am I gonna do?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.880
I don't even know where to start.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.520
I never worked a day in my life.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.000
Oh, I know, I know, I know.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:43.920
Our office is looking for

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:44.760
a secretary.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:45.400
You should apply.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.920
Oh, and the boss is

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.560
gorgeous - like,

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:49.800
out-of-this-world hot.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.320
Is he that toxic suit?

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.560
Oh, stop it.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.560
Any girl will do anything

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:54.760
to spend a night with him.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.160
When's the interview?
